  "description": "2000W Dual Motor\n\nThe Lankeleisi X2000max is equipped with dual 1000W front and rear motors, each providing a maximum torque of 95Nm, making it effortless to tackle 40° inclines. The display allows you to adjust the power output of both motors or use just one motor, giving you the flexibility to optimize performance for various terrains and ride efficiently.\n\n48V 20Ah SAMSUNG Li-ion Battery\n\nThe Lankeleisi X2000max features a Samsung 48V 20Ah battery with 21700 cells, offering a compact design with high capacity for long-distance rides. It provides up to 130 km in pedal assist mode and 70 km in full electric mode. The durable and reliable battery ensures safe and consistent performance throughout your ride.\n\nFront Fork Suspension\n\nThe Lankeleisi X2000max features an upgraded aluminum hydraulic double-wishbone suspension, with a 120mm compression travel on the front fork. This fork effectively absorbs shocks, reducing strain on the rider's arms and alleviating fatigue during long rides. The lockable fork design allows riders to adjust the suspension for various riding conditions, ensuring optimal performance.\n\nLCD Color Display\n\nColour Backlight Display to keep track of speed, mileage, power and more.",
